0555   29                     ADD   HL,HL   
0556   CB 21                  SLA   C   
0558   17                     RLA      
0559   30 01                  JR   NC,mus3   
055B   19                     ADD   HL,DE   
055C                MUS3:        
055C   29                     ADD   HL,HL   
055D   CB 21                  SLA   C   
055F   17                     RLA      
0560   30 01                  JR   NC,mus4   
0562   19                     ADD   HL,DE   
0563                MUS4:        
0563   29                     ADD   HL,HL   
0564   CB 21                  SLA   C   
0566   17                     RLA      
0567   30 01                  JR   NC,mus5   
0569   19                     ADD   HL,DE   
056A                MUS5:        
056A   29                     ADD   HL,HL   
056B   CB 21                  SLA   C   
